<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets warrants on basket of HK financial stocks.</title>
<headline>SGA sets warrants on basket of HK financial stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGA, Societe Generale Acceptance NV said on Wednesday it is issuing 80 million American style call warrants on shares of a basket of six Hong Kong financial stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Manhattan Card Co Ltd	   2   shares</p>
<p> JCG Holdings Ltd		  1   share</p>
<p> Liu Chong Hing Bank Ltd	 0.5 shares</p>
<p> Dao Heng Bank Group Ltd	 0.2 shares</p>
<p> Ka Wah Bank Ltd		   2   shares</p>
<p> National Mutual Asia Ltd	1   share</p>
<p>		  Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$47.075    PREMIUM	 14 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.659     GEARING	 7.14x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  16.JAN.98    EXER LOT	20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 05.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
